  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6bbe5e923751fa748af65c8e2b6c3986, type: 3}
  m_Name: DiaryStartingEntries
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  <entries>k__BackingField:
  - PassengerName: Day 1
    Entry: "My duty is simple: to check the tickets, to keep order, to ensure that\r\nevery
      passenger reaches their destination.\r\nAt least, that\u2019s what they told
      me when they sent me here.\r\nYet the longer this journey lasts, the less I
      understand where we are\r\ntruly heading.\r\nSome passengers look as though
      they are travelling for the first\r\ntime."
  - PassengerName: Day 1
    Entry: 'Others, as if they know way too much.

      This train does not stop
      in ordinary places. I do not know who writes

      the timetable of this
      voyage. Nor do I know what lies at its end.

      And I?

      I am to
      keep order.

      And not ask questions.'
